{{> header}}
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>An account was created for you in <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> on Flowdesk. Choose a password to activate it. The link is valid for {{ttlHours}} hours.</p>
<p style="margin:28px 0;">
  <a href="{{url}}" style="background:#4f46e5;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Set my password</a>
</p>
<p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">If the button doesn't work, copy this link into your browser:<br /><a href="{{url}}" style="color:#4f46e5;word-break:break-all;">{{url}}</a></p>
{{> footer}}
